## Per-App Setup Pattern

For each new app that needs Vault secrets, the script `/opt/vault/scripts/vault-pod-setup.sh` handles
the repeatable part. Prompts for: app name, namespace, service account, secret key/value pairs. Creates:

- `secret/<app-name>/config` — the KV secret
- `<app-name>-policy` — read-only access to that path
- `<app-name>` role in `auth/kubernetes` — bound to the SA + namespace

Then the app's deployment manifest gets the annotations above with `serviceAccountName` pointing to the
right SA.

